  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c894148543f7423449eb5eaaa49ebf7a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ConseilsAleatoire
  texte: {fileID: 354722777}
  conseils:
  - An unsatisfied customer will keep on coming to your shop, until you either fulfill his request...or completely mess it up!
  - Some ingredients are noble, and some are cursed...be careful what you choose to put on your cauldron...
  - 'Dilemma, your cat, gives you an indication on your score as a Witch : are you making your clients happy or unhappy? A quick look at your cat should give you a hint...'
  - You want your clients to be happy? Then be careful at the symbols they are asking for, and match them with the ones on your ingredients...
